SUMMARY:How Do Saudi Films Profit?
DESCRIPTION:This session examines the state of the Saudi box office\, focusing on the performance of Saudi films within the local cinema market. It discusses the factors that shape a film&rsquo\;s commercial success\, key revenue streams\, and the position of Saudi films in comparison to international releases. The session also highlights the role of marketing and promotional strategies in strengthening the presence of Saudi films and attracting audiences.
